---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="container">
  <div class="eyebrow">IoT R&amp;D Engineer · Cloud · Edge · Embedded</div>
  <h1>VENKATESH<br/>BOKKA</h1>
  <p>I build connected systems from device to edge to cloud — with a focus on AWS IoT, Azure IoT, industrial connectivity, Python and embedded platforms.</p>
  <div class="buttons">
    <a class="btn primary" href="#projects">Explore projects</a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/venkatesh-bokka-983b99126/" target="_blank">LinkedIn ↗</a>
  </div>
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><strong>8+</strong><span>Years engineering</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong>AWS</strong><span>IoT &amp; cloud</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong>Edge</strong><span>Embedded systems</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong>IIoT</strong><span>Industrial connectivity</span></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="about"><div class="container">
  <div class="eyebrow">01 / About</div><h2>Engineering systems that connect.</h2>
  <p class="lead">I work across the full IoT stack: device firmware and gateways, protocols and edge applications, cloud ingestion, APIs, storage and analytics. My goal is to turn device data into reliable, scalable systems.</p>
</div></section>

<section id="skills"><div class="container">
  <div class="eyebrow">02 / Technical focus</div><h2>Tools I build with.</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card"><h3>Cloud &amp; IoT</h3><p>AWS IoT Core, Azure IoT, Lambda, API Gateway, S3, DynamoDB, Timestream, MQTT and REST APIs.</p><span class="tag">AWS</span><span class="tag">Azure</span><span class="tag">MQTT</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Device Provisioning</h3><p>AWS Fleet Provisioning with claim certificates and JITP/JITR, Azure DPS with X.509, symmetric keys or TPM, and LoRaWAN OTAA onboarding.</p><span class="tag">Identity</span><span class="tag">Certificates</span><span class="tag">OTAA</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Edge &amp; Embedded</h3><p>ESP32, Raspberry Pi, Arduino, BeagleBone and Linux-based edge systems.</p><span class="tag">ESP32</span><span class="tag">Linux</span><span class="tag">Edge</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Industrial IoT</h3><p>Node-RED, Modbus, OPC UA concepts, gateways, telemetry pipelines and device integration.</p><span class="tag">Node-RED</span><span class="tag">Modbus</span><span class="tag">IIoT</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Voice AI &amp; Chatbots</h3><p>Speech recognition, conversational intent, text-to-speech, AI orchestration and authorized IoT actions.</p><span class="tag">Speech</span><span class="tag">Chatbots</span><span class="tag">AI</span></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="projects"><div class="container">
  <div class="eyebrow">03 / Selected work</div><h2>Projects &amp; labs.</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card"><h3>AWS IoT Platform</h3><p>Device connectivity, MQTT telemetry, Thing Registry, policies, Fleet Provisioning and cloud data pipelines.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>ESP32 IoT Gateway</h3><p>Embedded gateway experiments connecting sensors and field devices to modern IoT backends.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Industrial Edge</h3><p>Edge-first architectures using Linux, Python and Node-RED for protocol integration and local processing.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Azure IoT Platform</h3><p>Connected device telemetry, Azure IoT Hub, DPS onboarding, device management and cloud analytics.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>The Things Stack</h3><p>LoRaWAN device onboarding with OTAA credentials, Join Server integration and application data flows.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Mosquitto Broker</h3><p>Lightweight MQTT messaging for local development, edge gateways, device testing and telemetry routing.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Kafka Event Streaming</h3><p>Durable event streaming for high-volume telemetry, consumers, integrations and real-time processing.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Databricks Analytics</h3><p>Lakehouse analytics for telemetry processing, data pipelines, notebooks and operational insights.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Ignition Industrial Platform</h3><p>Industrial data collection, SCADA visualization, tag management and plant monitoring with Ignition.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Digital Twin</h3><p>Map live sensor and equipment data into a visual model for clearer industrial system monitoring.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>IoT Provisioning App</h3><p>Device onboarding with claim certificates, JITP/JITR, Azure DPS attestation and LoRaWAN OTAA credentials.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Custom Linux for Edge</h3><p>Build a focused Linux image for reliable gateways, local processing, device services and field deployment.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Voice Chatbots</h3><p>Voice-enabled assistants that understand speech, report device status and trigger authorized IoT actions.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Chatbots &amp; AI Integration</h3><p>Connect conversational AI to cloud APIs, telemetry data, operational workflows and connected devices.</p><span class="status">Coming soon</span></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="architecture"><div class="container">
  <div class="eyebrow">04 / Architecture</div><h2>Provision → Connect → Stream → Understand</h2>
  <p class="lead">A project-aligned architecture for secure devices, industrial data and operational insight.</p>
  <div class="arch">
    <div class="node">Provision<br/>AWS Fleet / Azure DPS</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Identity<br/>X.509 / JITP / OTAA</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Device registry<br/>Secure onboarding</div>
  </div>
  <div class="arch">
    <div class="node">Sensors<br/>ESP32 / PLC</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Custom Linux<br/>Ignition / OPC UA</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Mosquitto / MQTT<br/>The Things Stack</div>
  </div>
  <div class="arch">
    <div class="node">AWS IoT<br/>Azure IoT</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Kafka<br/>Event streaming</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Databricks<br/>Lakehouse analytics</div>
  </div>
  <div class="arch">
    <div class="node">Telemetry<br/>Device state</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Digital Twin<br/>3D context</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Operations<br/>Dashboards / APIs</div>
  </div>
  <div class="arch">
    <div class="node">Voice input<br/>Speech-to-text</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Chatbot / AI<br/>Intent and permissions</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">IoT response<br/>Text-to-speech / actions</div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="contact"><div class="container">
  <div class="eyebrow">05 / Contact</div><h2>Let's build something connected.</h2>
  <p class="lead">For IoT engineering, cloud, edge or industrial connectivity opportunities, reach out through GitHub or LinkedIn.</p>
  <div class="buttons">
    <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:venkateshbokka232@gmail.com">Email me</a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/venkateshbokka" target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/venkatesh-bokka-983b99126/" target="_blank">LinkedIn ↗</a>
  </div>
</div></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="container"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Venkatesh Bokka</span><span>Built for IoT engineering.</span></div></footer>
</Layout>
